{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Link Click: Bridon Arc","In order to save the deceased Cheng Xiaoshi, Lu Guang returned to the beginning and started anew along the path of destiny. However, a photograph carrying clues about Cheng Xiaoshi's parents appeared at the Time Photo Studio. To uncover the truth, Lu Guang, with a heart full of anxiety, went to Yingdu with Cheng Xiaoshi. Facing people with different purposes, such as the seemingly friendly popular model Xia Fei, the eccentric leader of Chinatown Vein, and the mysteriously appearing Liu Xiao... can Lu Guang break the destined dead end?\n\n\n\n(Source: Bilibili)\n\n\n- The first episode aired with a runtime of ~65 minutes."],"ja":["时光代理人英都篇",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":49413,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":61607,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-56752","ids":{"shikimori":56752,"mal":56752,"anilist":170166,"kodik":"serial-64010"},"kodikIds":["serial-64008","serial-64004","serial-64010"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-64008":"2025-01-31T10:21:16Z","serial-64004":"2025-01-31T15:39:06Z","serial-64010":"2025-01-31T13:41:37Z"},"title":"Агент времени: Глава о британской столице","originalTitle":"Shiguang Dailiren: Yingdu Pian","alt":"Link Click: Bridon Arc / Link Click: Yingdu Chapter Link Click: Bridon Arc 时光代理人英都篇","description":"Лу Гуан Лу теряет всё, когда таинственный незнакомец врывается в фотостудию, которую он снимает вместе со своим близким другом Чэн Сяоши Чэн. Пришелец, вознамерившийся покарать обитателей студии за игры со временем, хладнокровно убивает Цяо Лин Цяо и Чэн Сяоши. Однако Лу Гуан наследует способность друга перемещаться назад во времени и решает спасти всех от их страшной участи. Оказавшись в прошлом, Лу Гуан отправляется в Бридон, чтобы помочь Чэн Сяоши разыскать отца, но обнаруживает череду странных несовпадений, из-за которых ситуация превращается в полную неопределённость. Внезапно лишившись возможности предсказывать будущее, Лу Гуан вынужден придумать новую стратегию, чтобы расстроить планы человека, отнявшего у него всё.","year":2024,"type":"ONA","genres":["Драма","взрослые персонажи","супер сила","путешествие во времени"],"rating":8.3,"popularity":33889,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[49413,61607],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/56752/b443f7ca0c53787b45e31dad4c6f882a.jpeg","width":740,"height":990},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/170166-CNPbSd1EDfMf.jpg","width":1900,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":3,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-64008","translationId":"910","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1399601/be652c90a3382e20c7a850c80c250071/720p","season":3,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1291","dubId":"1291","label":"Crunchyroll.Subtitles","language":"zh","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-64004","translationId":"1291","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1399508/85e93e9b3962cf4c0bea28d5c8d1b17d/720p","season":3,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-923","dubId":"923","label":"AnimeVost","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-64010","translationId":"923","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1399610/93c2a6a6630984c61bcc1a4693b546f6/720p","season":3,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":3,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-910","dubId":"910","label":"AniStar","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider